Hi Lee,

Got the manual here...
To be defined at SRM level:
Handle                            Slot
IOBASE                  DMA                         IRQ
PCXBJ                           2                                 530,
388                  0,1                             9

Table H2 ISA Equipment configuration page H3

So at the SRM >>> prompt use the following command :
isacfg -slot 2 -etyp 1 -mk -iobase0 530 -iobase1 388 -irq0 9 -dmachan0 0
-dmachan1 1 -handle PCXBJ -enadev 1

that does the trick on a 200 4/233 should be OK on a 250 4/266.

Hope that helps.

Regards

Alain Hache


