I built ES40 cluster last month and I sufferred the same network problem
as you.
I decided to change all network adaptor form DE600-BA(intel chipset) to
DE500-BA (digital chipset). Although DE600-BA use intel chipset, it
differ from traditional intel NIC, because in 2.2.16 kernel there is the
problem as you sufferred. Someone said that 2.2.14 kernel shows no
problem, but I didn't test in 2.2.14 kernel.
To recognize all memory, use bigmem patch in 2.2.x kernel or use 2.4
kernel. I used 2.4 kernel for big-mem.
 
> The 2.4.0 kernel has the same network problem and it works unstable.
