>Is there a step that I am missing in Fdisk?? Do I have to toggle a
>bootable flag? I am unclear on this point..

There are no bootable flags with BSD labels.  SRM can boot any partition 
you want, whenever you want.  "Bootable" or "Active" flags are for a DOS 
label, and non applicable to Alphas in general.


